# The site is pre-built and committed in public/ (served as-is by Vercel).
# IMPORTANT: every pattern is ROOT-ANCHORED with a leading slash so it can
# NEVER accidentally match the same-named folder inside public/
# (a bare "assets/" would match public/assets/ too and strip our CSS/JS -> 404).
/scripts/
/notebooks/
/notes/
/exercises/
/data/
/assets/
/site/
/requirements.txt
/*.py
/.pytmp/
/.pipcache/
